median of 420 ms for the host.\n\n**Next**\n\n- **The rest of wave 1**, in batches of about fifty, from the owner's\n  computer. The pilot (*What it costs*) passed 26 of 32 games for $16.96;\n  those 26 are dealt now. First, end a game's Haiku 5.5 tries when one exits\n  without changing anything, and rerun the three games hub-check gave no\n  report on, now that it says why.\n\n- **Attract mode after 10 s idle** on the title screen: in a session there is\n  no title screen, so it never starts there. No conflict.\n- **Testing \"efficient\"**: the agent can still run the harness from the\n  protocol's *Test it*; the hub checks every game at import either way.\n- **Up to four players locally, controller first**: welcome. Couch co-op in\n  one room is the game's own; remote couch co-op is pinned.\n\nIf cc-matrix builds are imported, the hub's importer (`import-matrix-runs.mjs`,\nwritten for gpt-matrix's layout) needs to learn cc-matrix's `runs/<id>/work/`\nlayout: an ai-hub change, made when the first cc-matrix builds come in.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0195BhikYojE6Pxw9jiWd4JE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
