it":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":87,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"`PLAN.md` now covers everything `TASK.md` asks for, and I checked that line by line instead of relying on my own summary. The audit found no gaps across 98 clauses. It's a text check, so it shows each requirement is addressed in the plan, not how well a builder will carry it out.\n\n**Added to the plan after your hook's objection:**\n- **Source Information:** all 14 fields, in `TASK.md`'s order, each saying what to write. `Usage` stays exactly `added on import`, kept easy to find for the agent that imports the game.\n- **Feedback questions:** all 14 Testing, Engine and Prompt questions, word for word and in order, plus a dev log kept from day one so the answers are real.\n- **About/Credits:** a five-page layout that keeps to the 10-foot rules, with a browser test that every field and answer is present.\n- **Exit interview and final reply:** the exact JSON shape, the allowed values, suggested `aiHub` values, and a template for the final chat reply.\n- **Smaller gaps:**\n  - a schedule of when the player first meets each feature\n  - a rule that the game explains what can't be done\n  - the WebKit iPhone test\n  - the `uv` tip\n  - the \"never kill whatever holds a port\" rule\n- **Coverage table:** section 22 now lists every requirement in `TASK.md`'s order.\n\n**What the audit compared, reading `TASK.md` directly:**\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Clauses checked in `TASK.md`'s order | 98, none missing |\n| Source Information fields | 14 of 14, same order |\n| Feedback questions, word for word | 4 of 4, 6 of 6, 4 of 4, same order |\n| Exit interview JSON keys | identical to `TASK.md`'s |\n| `aiHub` genres | all 16 listed |\n| Suggested tags | all from `TASK.md`'s examples |\n| `TASK.md`'s file and folder names in the plan | none |\n\n**Two parts of the hook's objection I didn't act on, because `STAGE.md` rules them out:**\n- **Building the game:** `STAGE.md` says other agents build from this plan, so there's still no game, by design.\n- **The HTML file name:** `STAGE.md` says to leave out `TASK.md`'s file names, so the plan tells each builder to use the name in its own `TASK.md`.","ttft_ms":1328,"type":"result","duration_ms":4380881,"uuid":"af32ef35-51b4-4cdb-a017-037696b55dc3","ttft_stream_ms":1000,"time_to_request_ms":164,"first_content_frame_ms":1001,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":138,"outputTokens":270446,"cacheReadInputTokens":16016616,"cacheCreationInputTokens":424956,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":12.012443200000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":148518,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":424956,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":563,"cacheReadInputTokens":260901,"cacheCreationInputTokens":282536,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.19104155000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":282536,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-03T10:53:37.765Z"}
